---

---

<section class="details" aria-labelledby="details-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="details-title">It keeps the room <span class="em">together,</span> quietly.</h2>

    <ul class="rows">
      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>Someone opens a different title</h3>
          <p>
            Your friends get a choice: follow you, or carry on with their own thing. Nobody gets
            dragged anywhere.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="card">
            <p>Sam opened The Night Train, S1:E3.</p>
            <p class="row">
              <span class="b">Watch on my own</span><span class="b primary"
                >Continue with Sam</span
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>Next episode, together</h3>
          <p>
            When the room moves on, everyone moves on. On Prime Video you pick the next episode in
            the player yourself.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="ep">
            <span>S1:E3</span>
            <svg width="40" height="14" viewBox="0 0 40 14"
              ><path
                d="M1 7h36m-6-5 6 5-6 5"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="1.6"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
            >
            <span class="next">S1:E4</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>Small slips fix themselves</h3>
          <p>
            Players drift a little over a long film. WatchSync nudges yours back without a sound. If
            you fall far behind, one press of Sync brings you back.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pill">
            <span class="f ok">S</span><span class="f">A</span><span class="f ok">R</span>
            <span class="b primary">Sync</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>Watch on my own, for a bit</h3>
          <p>
            Rewind a scene you missed or skip ahead alone. The room carries on, and Sync puts you
            back where everyone is.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pill">
            <span class="f ok">S</span><span class="f ok">A</span><span class="f ok">R</span>
            <span class="b">Watch on my own</span><span class="b">Move left</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>A small pill, even in full screen</h3>
          <p>
            It shows who's here and who's in sync, sits in a corner of the player, and fades out
            with the player's own controls.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pill small">
            <span class="f ok">S</span><span class="f ok">A</span><span class="f ok">R</span>
          </div>
          <span class="bar"><span></span></span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <div class="text">
          <h3>Wi‑Fi drops, browsers restart</h3>
          <p>
            WatchSync reconnects on its own and puts you back in your room. If you restart Chrome,
            you rejoin where you were.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="states">
            <span class="badge warn">Reconnecting…</span>
            <span class="badge ok">Connected</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .details {
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 13vw, 200px);
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    max-width: 14em;
  }
  .rows {
    margin: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .rows li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 var(--line);
  }
  .text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.3rem);
    font-weight: 520;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-variation-settings:
      "opsz" 72,
      "SOFT" 100;
  }
  .text p {
    color: var(--text2);
    max-width: 32rem;
  }
  .mock {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 150px;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 340px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(214, 236, 240, 0.12);
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .b {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--raised);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .b.primary {
    background: var(--acc);
    color: var(--on-acc);
  }
  .ep {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .ep .next {
    color: var(--acc);
  }
  .pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--bg);
    box-shadow:
      0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
      inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line2);
  }
  .pill .b {
    height: 28px;
  }
  .f {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--raised);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #7f9092;
  }
  .f.ok {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--pres);
  }
  .f.ok::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -2px;
    bottom: -2px;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pres);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--bg);
  }
  .frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    min-height: 0;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 70% at 70% 30%, rgba(255, 196, 120, 0.25), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(#1d4350, #0c1b22);
  }
  .frame .pill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
  }
  .frame .bar {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 16px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(236, 242, 241, 0.25);
  }
  .frame .bar span {
    display: block;
    width: 46%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: #ecf2f1;
  }
  .states {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .badge {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .badge.warn {
    background: rgba(255, 159, 74, 0.14);
    color: var(--warn);
  }
  .badge.ok {
    background: var(--pres-soft);
    color: var(--pres);
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .rows li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
